    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald Paul Reynolds are offering for sale this Mid-Terraced Property in Milltown, Convoy\nThis well-presented property occupies a long site within a quiet residential development in Milltown, just minutes from the village of Convoy.\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation comprising a welcoming living room, kitchen/dining area, three bedrooms and a shower room. The home is presented in good condition throughout and provides an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, families or investors.\nExternally, the property benefits from a city-style front garden and an impressive long, landscaped garden to the rear. The property enjoys a pleasant outlook over a green area, with useful outbuildings providing additional storage to the rear."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.5 x 1.0\nTiled flooring\n\nHallway - 3.1 x 1.8\nLaminated timber flooring. Under stair storage area. Carpet covered staircase leading to first floor.\n\nLiving Room - 4.6 x 3.0\nLaminated timber flooring. Open fireplace with back boiler to compliment the oil fired heating.\n\nKitchen/Dining area - 5.5 x 3.0\nTiled flooring. Eye and low level units with single drainer sink and tiled splash back. Electric oven with four ring hob and overhead extractor fan. Plumbed for dishwasher. Feature archway divide kitchen from dining area. Ample dining area and door leading to side of property.\n\nShower Room - 2.0 x 2.0\nLinoleum covering on floor. Comprising w.c, wash hand basin and shower.\n\nLanding - 1.8 x 1.5\nCarpet covering on floor. Trap door to attic space.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.9 x 2.7\nCarpet covering on floor. Built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.7 x 3.0\nCarpet covering on floor.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.2 x 2.0\nCarpet covering on floor.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Mid Terraced Property</li><li>Constructed 1970</li><li>Total Floor area 81 sq m</li><li>Presented well throughout</li><li>Comprising 3 bedrooms</li><li>Dual fired heating</li><li>Occupying long site with city style garden to front and mature garden, stocked with shrubs/plants to rear.</li><li>Outbuildings to the rear.</li><li>Situated within the mature residential development of Milltown.</li><li>Minutes from Convoy village</li><li>Overlooking green area to the front.</ul>"
      },
